# The Black Coffin (ToAU 15): the area without the coin. Status 0, no coin: one walk, one tick after login, before
# the area's handler runs, so the area is not entered (a fake check pins the arm). Then Status 2, no coin: a walk
# out and back in; the area runs and plays nothing (onTriggerAreaEnter returns nil).
lists ArrapagoReef/onTriggerAreaEnter/1 ArrapagoReef/onEventFinish/35 ArrapagoReef/onZoneIn/1 Nashmau/onZoneIn/1 Nashmau/onEventFinish/281
char zone=ArrapagoReef pos=-463.026,-2,-394.478 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Toau TheBlackCoffin current
login
tick 1000
walk -458,-2,-400
finish-if-event
missionstatus Toau 2
walk -463.026,-2,-394.478
walk -458,-2,-400
finish-if-event
